{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1570 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "602791fa1b0740a5251bced8e4035b702b980524e28301e53da2ea9200e802d2" :edb/db-before-t 1569 :edb/db-after-t 1570 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534882 50 #inst "2026-10-12T22:25:29.107Z" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186127213 1078 #edb/ref 17592186127218 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186128985 1071 "Which of the following equalities are true given that\n$D = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq x \\leq 2, \\: 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\big\\}.$\n\n- $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}} \\,\\text{d}A  = \\int_{0}^{1}  \\int_{0}^{2}e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,  \\text{d}y \\, \\text{d}x$\n\n- $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,\\text{d}A  = \\int_{0}^{2}  \\int_{0}^{1} e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\, \\text{d}y\\,  \\text{d}x$\n\n- $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}} \\,\\text{d}A = \\int_{0}^{1}  \\int_{0}^{2}e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,  \\text{d}x \\, \\text{d}y$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 false] [17592186128985 1071 "Which of the following equalities are true given that\n$D = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq x \\leq 2, \\: 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\big\\}.$\n\nI. $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}} \\,\\text{d}A  = \\int_{0}^{1}  \\int_{0}^{2}e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,  \\text{d}y \\, \\text{d}x$\n\nII. $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,\\text{d}A  = \\int_{0}^{2}  \\int_{0}^{1} e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\, \\text{d}y\\,  \\text{d}x$\n\nIII. $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}} \\,\\text{d}A = \\int_{0}^{1}  \\int_{0}^{2}e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,  \\text{d}x \\, \\text{d}y$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129164 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442477 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129164 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442479 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129164 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442480 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129165 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442481 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129166 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442478 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129166 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442482 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129338 1050 960.0 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129622 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129622 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}A$, where $D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,1\\le y\\le 4\\}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186129622 1071 "Evaluate the double integral $∬_(D)\\sqrt{x^{3}y}dA$, where $D = {(x, y): 0 \\le x \\le 1, 1 \\le y \\le 4}$." 13194139534882 17592186045417 false] [17592186129622 1074 "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{y}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{y}{[\\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5/2}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{y}(\\frac{2}{5}(1)^{5/2}-\\frac{2}{5}(0)^{5/2})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{2}{5}\\sqrt{y}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{2}{5}\\sqrt{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\frac{2}{5}{\\int }_{1}^{4}{y}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}{[\\frac{2{y}^{3/2}}{3}]}_{1}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}((4)^{3/2}-(1)^{3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{15}(8-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{28}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186130412 1064 "Consider the surface $z= f(x,y) = 3-x^2-y^2,$ defined over the following rectangle:\n\n$$\nR=[0,1] \\times [0,1] = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq x \\leq 1, \\: 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\big\\}.\n$$\n\nA sketch of our surface and its domain is shown below.\n\n![](images/1f/1fdf4668c7e89a9a32ee8e655fe5c80c899a04d25a0f342365560f4d9abdd8fd.png)\n\n \n\nThe **double integral** of $f(x,y)$ over $R,$ denoted\n\n$$\n\\iint\\limits_{R}{ f(x,y) \\, \\mathrm{d}A},\n$$\n\nrepresents the total *signed* volume bounded between the surface $z=f(x,y)$ and the planes $x=0, x=1, y=0, y=1.$\n\nIt can be shown that the double integral \n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{R} {{(3-x^2-y^2) \\, \\mathrm{d}A}},\n$$\n\ncan be evaluated using the repeated integral \n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int_0^1\\int_0^1 (3-x^2-y^2) \\, \\mathrm{d}  x\\,  \\mathrm{d}  y.\n$$\n\nNotice that we replace $\\textrm d A$ with $\\textrm d x\\,\\textrm d y$ when writing our double integral as a repeated integral." 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186130412 1064 "Consider the surface $z= f(x,y) = 3-x^2-y^2,$ defined over the following rectangle:\n\n$$\nR=[0,1] \\times [0,1] = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq x \\leq 1, \\: 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\big\\}.\n$$\n\nA sketch of our surface and its domain is shown below.\n\n![](images/1f/1fdf4668c7e89a9a32ee8e655fe5c80c899a04d25a0f342365560f4d9abdd8fd.png)\n\nThe **double integral** of $f(x,y)$ over $R,$ denoted\n\n$$\n\\iint\\limits_{R}{ f(x,y) \\, \\mathrm{d}A},\n$$\n\nrepresents the total *signed* volume bounded between the surface $z=f(x,y)$ and the planes $x=0, x=1, y=0, y=1.$\n\nIt can be shown that the double integral \n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{R} {{(3-x^2-y^2) \\, \\mathrm{d}A}},\n$$\n\ncan be evaluated using the repeated integral \n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int_0^1\\int_0^1 (3-x^2-y^2) \\, \\mathrm{d}  x\\,  \\mathrm{d}  y.\n$$\n\nNotice that we replace $\\textrm d A$ with $\\textrm d x\\,\\textrm d y$ when writing our double integral as a repeated integral." 13194139534882 17592186045417 false] [17592186339082 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 4\\}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186339082 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 4}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 false] [17592186339083 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 2\\}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186339083 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 2}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 false] [17592186382242 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 2,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1\\}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186382242 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 2,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1}.$" 13194139534882 17592186045417 false] [17592186442441 1080 "3({e}^{2}+1)" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442441 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442441 1083 #uuid "1c72710f-c2e6-5f98-9934-8c0e10db39f6" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442442 1080 "\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442442 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442442 1083 #uuid "1f8087da-0be9-5661-8053-ef364f6d08fe" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442443 1080 "4" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442443 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442443 1083 #uuid "258eca96-5244-5ca3-b0df-8541f47f4e9b" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442444 1080 "I and II only" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442444 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442444 1083 #uuid "27ca5ad7-f8d3-561b-9a26-e9c7eb4baa19" 13194139534882 17592186045417 true] [17592186442445 1080 "I a